m/user:info/frozen-starry-sky" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6114202&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608234545" alt="Frozen starry sky" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6114202)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/frozen-starry-sky" >Frozen starry sky</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>我永远都是A老师的忠诚铁粉（○｀ 3′○）馅饼酱你还欠我一局文明6ヽ(✿ﾟ▽ﾟ)ノ——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aetherium" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5657018&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608234545" alt="aetherium" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5657018)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aetherium" >aetherium</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">饼子做我女朋友！——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raidwine" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6455279&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608234545" alt="Raidwine" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6455279)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raidwine" >Raidwine</a></span></span> <span style="color: red"><em>已否决</em></span><br /> 她是我的（。）——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/smith-sister-con" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4381648&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608234545" alt="Smith_sister-con" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4381648)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/smith-sister-con" >Smith_sister-con</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>《阿拉伯机械帝国史》，历史控深深得满足ing——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6591621&amp;amp;